{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeuCpH64ymhjm56k8aQTW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found two real, distinct issues — not test flakiness:\n\n1. **Environment**: `_ipc.py` computes `paths.tmp_dir()` at import time, which resolves via `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` to a directory this sandbox denies access to. This crashes test collection before any test runs.\n2. **Actual code bug**: `press_key()`'s fallback for single characters uses the literal character as `code` and `ord(char)` as the virtual key code, instead of real US-keyboard physical key codes (e.g. `\"H\"` instead of `\"KeyH\"`), and never flags non-US characters (é, 中, 😀) as having no physical key. Four tests fail on this for real reasons.\n\nI'm not going to delete or skip these tests to fake a green build — that would hide a real environment fragility and a real bug in key-event synthesis. Let me fix both properly; this is a contained fix."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1200,"cache_read_input_tokens":50892,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1200},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9ad40c43-ed88-42ec-89b7-bb6070252db2","uuid":"f03bee17-1bc6-40bf-923f-b9917e1eaa3b","timestamp":"2026-09-10T05:27:22.912Z","request_id":"req_011CeuCpGLBNXFUXFFxNpYnF"}
